WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:03.280
The princess is wavering...

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:06.940
...like a fruit, falling from a light breeze.

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:10.600
I'll leave it to you to give her a push in the right direction.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.690
Understood?

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:13.270
Of course.

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:16.160
Please leave everything to us, Hibiki-sama.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:18.830
I am unaccustomed to waiting.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:22.340
We'll need to take drastic measures with the princess.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.070
Cera.

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:56.530
Leika.

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:02.000
Britney.

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:07.180
Tyna.

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:11.960
Celebrity 4!

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.100
Run! SummDrea GrandPrix!

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.140
This is PriPara News.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.200
It's time for the long awaited event:

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.560
the Summer Idol GrandPrix!

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:56.190
Among its numerous entries,

00:02:56.190 --> 00:03:01.990
a popular top class team that's above even the Major Class...

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:05.240
...has submitted their entries from across the ocean.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:07.660
They decided to participate at the last moment.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:11.620
Coming all the way from EuroPara's PriPara, it's Celebrity 4!

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.440
I wonder who will become their fifth member.

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:18.840
In any case, I have no doubt that they'll become the fan favourite in no time!

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.060
Eh?!

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:20.890
Foreigners?

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:22.090
Top idols?

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:30.440
Prince-sama is expecting great things of me.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:33.690
But do I really want to be the princess?

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:36.320
Oh no! You've been staring like that for a while-tori!

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:39.530
Fuwari, you've become a narcissist-tori!

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:41.620
No way! It's Celebrity 4!

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.520
They're SummDrea's special guests!

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:45.240
They're so cute!

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.800
Nice to meet you, Fuwari-chan.

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:51.010
Who are you?

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:53.440
We're Celebrity 4.

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:57.130
Hibiki-sama has scouted us to ensure your victory in the SummDrea.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.050
Huh?

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.300
Prince-sama did?

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:01.530
Wow, you're pretty.

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:04.590
So you're the princess Hibiki-sama chose, huh?

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:08.680
Now then, team up with us.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:12.240
Become elegant, and then gorgeous!

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:15.410
Do all of you know Prince-sama?

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:16.300
Of course.

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:19.800
We always agree with Hibiki-sama.

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:21.200
And we've vowed to...

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.280
...make Hibiki-sama's ideals a reality!

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.840
<i>What beautiful people.</i>

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:31.000
<i>I wonder if Prince-sama is talking with girls other than me?</i>

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.360
Fuwari?

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:34.120
These girls? What's going on-tori?

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:40.390
A back-country girl from the Palps such as yourself should feel honoured to be able to team up with us.

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:43.210
There you have it. Now let's go submit our entry right away.

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:44.830
U-Um...

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:49.100
I'm not sure that I want to become the princess.

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:52.450
There's no need to worry, Fuwari-chan.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:57.240
If you're with us, you'll naturally acquire the sense of an urban celeb.

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:59.730
Even if you are only a country hick.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:03.820
I'm sure we can become gorgeous friends.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:04.650
Yeah.

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:06.170
Our victory is assured.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:09.080
The others are all low ranking small fries.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:12.980
Let's use them as stepping stones and shine above them!

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:17.040
How dare you say such things about Toriko's idol!
Become elegant, and then gorgeous!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.790
Gorgeous celeb...

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:23.860
Is Prince-sama looking for a princess that's like these girls?

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:24.300
Fuwari is-

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.260
Shut it!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.930
Toriko-san!

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:29.230
Salt?

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:29.890
Tare?

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:31.530
Onions?

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:32.470
Thanks...

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:35.980
Thanks to you four, I've made my decision.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:36.630
Huh?

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:39.350
I've decided to give up being a princess.

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:42.190
Therefore I will not be forming a team with you.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.150
W-Wait!

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:45.170
Hold it right there!

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:48.790
Would it upset you if I went back to not becoming a princess?

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:53.200
Toriko will still love your songs even if you aren't a princess-tori.

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:55.550
Thank you, Toriko-san.

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.670
Stop!

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:01.590
Lala!

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:02.480
Fuwari.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:03.610
Perfect timing.

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:05.020
We were just searching for you.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:06.340
We want you to join our team.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:07.840
No, she'll be joining our team...

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:10.970
Lala, Shion, Dorthy, Leona...

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:14.810
I'd like to form a team with you four.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:15.850
Huh?

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:16.770
Eh?!

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:20.120
I finally understand what I really want.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:22.610
I am still Fuwari from the Palps.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:27.070
You taught me that it was okay to be myself.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:30.530
That's why I want to sing with the four of you!

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:31.610
Fuwari...

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:32.410
Tori!

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:35.370
I knew it would end up like this.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.200
Naturally I have no objections.

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:38.870
I'd be glad to!

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:40.710
W-Wait a minute-pri!

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.230
You can't do that-pri.

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:45.800
SoLaMi Smile has always been together-pri!

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:48.760
You don't want to sing with us, Lala?

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.380
No, that's not true...

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:52.490
What should I do?

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.990
Hey, just where were you looking?!

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:56.240
Back up! Back up!

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:56.850
You're terrible!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.690
How about you give it a go?!

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.010
Fuwari-chan!

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:02.490
Don't run off like that!

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:04.150
You made Onee-san sad!

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:08.550
What are you girls doing?!

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:09.570
Are you okay?

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:10.860
You're going overboard-pri.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:13.970
Shut your trap and mind your own business!

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:14.920
Huh?

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:17.070
You were all on the news earlier.

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:18.620
It's Celebrity 4!

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:22.700
Now then, Fuwari-chan, let's go submit our entry.

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:23.850
Entry?!

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:26.590
Even Celebrity 4 wants Fuwari to join them-pri?!

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:28.670
I'm won't do it.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.930
I'm teaming up with these four girls.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.200
Well, about that...

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:34.350
Come now, you're joking, right?

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:37.040
With such low ranked girls?

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.600
Even if you have no chance of winning?

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:39.420
Huh?

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:42.990
Whether you're celebs or not, you can't go around saying whatever you want.

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:43.800
What'd you say?!

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:44.980
If you're looking for a fight, you're on!

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:48.030
Even though we'll make you shine the brightest,

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.380
you're just going to throw the chance away?

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:52.450
We're saying it's for your own good.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:54.450
I guess we've got no choice.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.360
You're coming with us.

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:56.800
Hold on.

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:57.550
What are you doing-tori?!

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:58.500
You don't have the option to refuse!

00:07:58.500 --> 00:07:59.500
Stop-tori!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.290
Slice in two!

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:05.350
It's extremely rude to force someone into something they don't want!

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:07.170
We won't let you take Fuwari!

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:08.250
That's right! That's right!

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:14.360
You small fry idols think you can go against us?!

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.430
Gorgeous!

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:17.890
Pri!

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:21.640
Fuwari-chan, why won't you just come with us?

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:22.810
What should we do-tori?

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:23.960
Run!

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:24.850
Capisce!

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:27.820
Gorgeous!

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.070
Let's get out of here-tori!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.460
Toriko will stay behind-tori.

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:34.300
Toriko will only bring misfortune-tori.

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:37.030
Fuwari, you'd better make it out alive-tori!

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:39.900
Give it up already!

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.900
I'm not cut out for this.

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:44.080
They've already crossed the river.

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:45.570
There's a bridge!

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:46.540
Lucky!

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:54.160
Oh? So Shikyouin-san called Celebrity 4.

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:57.270
Are you really giving up on becoming a princess?

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:59.220
Yeah, I've made up my mind.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:02.440
Huh? Toriko-san's not here.

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:04.190
I wonder where she went.

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:06.150
Gorgeous Attack!

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:12.940
Gorgeous Attack!

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:15.200
Mirelle!

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.270
Sophie-san!

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:17.360
Pushuu~.

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:20.210
This way!

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:20.660
Good idea.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.510
Hey! Block heads!

00:09:22.510 --> 00:09:24.410
What'd you say?!

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:30.000
P-Pushuu.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.390
Sophie-san!

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:33.730
You're hurt, aren't you, Mirelle?

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:35.390
It's nothing-pri.

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:37.840
Mirelle!

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:40.840
Don't push yourself. You need to take care of your legs.

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:43.600
Otherwise you'll have problems when you're dancing.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.060
Let's see...

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.270
I found some medicinal herbs.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.440
What are you doing?
What are you doing-pri?

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:52.870
Here.

00:09:52.870 --> 00:09:55.060
Disinfecting it with this will keep the swelling down.

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:56.280
Thank you-pri.

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:59.880
We've already gone pretty far-pri.

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:02.030
The GrandPrix will be starting soon...

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.700
If we don't hurry back, we won't be able to enter.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.500
We won't make it in time-pri.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:20.920
Don't worry, we have plenty of time.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:23.390
Everyone wants to hear our song.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:24.460
Really?

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:26.010
Don't give up.

00:10:26.010 --> 00:10:27.560
Let's sing together.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:30.120
That was great!

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:31.790
We lost them somehow.

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:32.480
Yeah.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.050
You're too heavy!
Come on!

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:35.320
What'd you say?!

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:37.640
What happened?

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:39.120
Are you injured?

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:41.070
Lala, go on without us.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:41.940
Eh?

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:43.780
Leave Sophie to me!

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:48.750
Show them the best five person concert on behalf of Sophie and I-pri!

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:49.920
But!

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.960
Fuwari, Shion, and the rest, go out and do your best!

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:54.800
Make sure to take care of Lala-pri!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:56.880
You have my word.
Sure.

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:00.340
Do your best!

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:02.070
Sophie...

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:04.880
Capisce!

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.770
Summer Dream Idol GrandPrix!

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:12.940
With hopes of being in the PriPara Dream Parade,

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:17.230
this is the first round out of four GrandPrix that will take place.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:20.360
The five members of the winning team...

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:26.440
...will be entered as candidates to be the princesses that will stand at the front of the parade.

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:30.330
Which team will become the summer stars?

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:31.840
Without further adieu,

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:33.340
let's get this started!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:38.760
Hey, you sure this is the right path?

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:40.840
Don't worry.

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:43.720
The wind flow, direction of the sun,

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:46.440
and that bird over there all say we'll be fine.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:53.600
Don't think you could just leave us behind!

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:54.640
They're still after us?

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:55.610
They sure are persistent!

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:58.530
Psychic power at maximum!

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.260
Strike-panda!

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:14.710
Summer bowling-panda!

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:16.170
Huh?!

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.090
Another one?!

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:22.050
That one's in the gutter for sure-panda.

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:24.510
Jump!

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:35.610
W-We're being swept down the river!

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:37.230
No way!

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:40.820
Driftwood!

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:42.110
Grab on!

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:44.070
Lala.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:49.490
H-Hey, anyone else getting a bad feeling?

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:50.950
Bad feeling?

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.880
There had to be a waterfall!

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:02.840
There had to be a waterfall!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:05.830
Serves you right!

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:08.010
Just let yourselves be washed down stream...!

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:10.760
Fuwari-chan, just give up on those members-

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:14.890
Gorgeous!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.690
What'd they come here for...

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:28.080
Don't!

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:29.780
Don't let go!

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:31.700
Everyone hold on tight!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:33.620
Hold on tight!

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:34.820
Fuwari!

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:35.790
Girls!

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.540
Don't dare let go, you two!

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.630
Dorthy!

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:40.250
It's not like I want to let go!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.420
Fuwari!

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.800
Do your best, everyone!

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:47.050
If you say so, Dorthy!

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:48.260
No letting go!

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.890
There's no way I'll let go...

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.560
...of my friends!

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.190
That's right.

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:56.060
After travelling so far and meeting all of you,

00:13:57.710 --> 00:14:03.730
we have to perform a concert together as friends!

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:09.990
Congratulations!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.870
A Dream Team has been born!

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:14.140
We've formed a Dream Team!

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:15.520
Hooray!

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:18.290
Let's see, our team name is...

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.530
Um...

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:21.500
Dressing Flower!

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.100
That's awesome!

00:14:26.020 --> 00:14:27.220
Fuwari!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:30.930
Toriko was really really worried about you and came to find you-tori!

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:50.160
How'd we get here?

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.780
To think that it led here...

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:54.740
Wasn't it kind of like an action packed adventure?

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:55.820
Eh?!

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:57.580
Is that something a princess would say?

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.130
You really are a nature girl.

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:01.210
We saw the natural splendour...

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:08.860
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:12.150
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.390
Coord Change Start!

00:15:20.970 --> 00:15:26.400
On top of the poppin' explorer outfit we have securely attached goggles, compass, and telescope.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:29.150
Surprise Summer Adventure Coord!

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:30.040
Go!

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:31.240
Yeah!

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:35.580
One mustn't forget the treasure map and attach it to your waist...

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.660
...as you wouldn't want to miss out on the SummDrea Challenge.

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:40.330
Perfect Summer Adventure Coord!

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:47.000
The five who overcame an unforgettable adventure...

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:48.920
...shall challenge yet another one.

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.590
Unforgettable Summer Adventure Coord!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:58.830
And that is all of our teams...

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:05.520
A team who just barely managed to enter on time has just arrived!

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:10.510
Somehow we made it in time-pri.

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:11.700
Yeah.

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:15.110
And here we have the newly formed Dream Team...

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:16.900
...Dressing Flower!

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:23.540
<i>Mirelle, Sophie, I hope you're watching...</i>

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:25.960
<i>I'll just sing like myself.</i>

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:30.510
Dream Theatre Concert Switch On!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:50.040
Airy Change!

00:17:54.590 --> 00:18:01.600
Cyalume Airy!

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:13.110
Thank you!

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:15.610
Tension max!

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:18.110
Relax!

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:20.240
Let's Go!

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:30.630
Let's ring the bell of everyone's dreams!

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:33.600
Everyone's dreams have become one!

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:40.220
Echo! Charm Bell!

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:48.600
There it is!

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:54.560
Somehow in their Cyalume Airy their costumes changed into the Summer Dream Parade Coord!

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:56.440
Dressing Flower is our winner!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.900
Of course they'd win-pri.

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:01.510
Toriko's idol won...

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:03.300
To... ri...

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.120
Kuma!
Usa!

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:07.000
Congratulations.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.900
That was a wonderful concert.

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:11.670
Hey! We rang the bell, right?

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:14.060
Then doesn't that mean our wish will come true?

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:18.590
No, as you didn't ring the Bell of Beginnings in unison,

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:20.020
it won't grant your dreams.

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:21.240
Eh?

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:22.680
That's how the system works.

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:25.140
Isn't winning good enough?

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.850
We're all friends!

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:28.450
We're all idols!

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:30.480
I'll continue doing my best!

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:33.550
I'm Fuwari, and I'm from the Palps.

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:35.480
The Palps's Fuwari!

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:42.860
I'm turning down the princess candidacy.

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:46.080
You are making the wrong choice.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.810
No, I've decided.

00:19:48.810 --> 00:19:51.990
Prince-sama, I...

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:54.500
No, Hibiki-sama, I don't really understand you.

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:57.660
But I'm still grateful.

00:19:57.660 --> 00:20:02.080
Since I was aiming to become the princess,

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:05.600
I learned a lot about PriPara, my precious friends,

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:09.650
and even how much my heart can hurt.

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:14.940
I will return to the Palps with these wonderful memories.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:17.680
Please excuse me.

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:29.790
Well of course. She was just a country girl.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.580
Playtime is over.

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:34.030
Andou, I wish to return home!

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:34.790
Prepare the car.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.040
Yes, Sir.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:38.500
And what shall I do with Celebrity 4?

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:41.100
Oh yeah.

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:43.130
They were a complete failure.

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:44.670
Send them back.

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:45.260
Yes, Sir.

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:47.600
Eh?!

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.400
We're all friends...

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.130
We're all idols...

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:03.610
You say?

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:06.230
What a joke.

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:08.450
PriPara is about the best of the best.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:10.800
There are more beautiful places.

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:13.230
It seems that everyone's forgotten.

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:17.340
Only geniuses who truly shine are allowed to stand on stage.

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:21.460
To discern between those who possess that radiance and those who do not,

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:24.910
I will reform PriPara.

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:27.510
Fuwari,

00:21:28.840 --> 00:21:30.010
you are a failure.

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:34.850
Next time, I'll steal it.

00:23:06.800 --> 00:23:09.530
Midorikaze-san, what do you mean by "good-bye"?

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:11.530
I'm returning to the Palps.

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:12.530
You're kidding!

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:13.910
Pushuu~.

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:15.910
Since I gave up being the princess candidate,

00:23:16.300 --> 00:23:18.410
I no longer have a reason to stay here.

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:19.790
Why did you quit?

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:21.170
It's such a waste.

00:23:21.170 --> 00:23:22.390
Neenee.

00:23:22.390 --> 00:23:23.470
Panda.

00:23:23.470 --> 00:23:26.120
Both the goat and panda are sad.

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:27.510
Wait, panda?

00:23:27.980 --> 00:23:28.880
Next time:

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:31.960
Genius? What's That-panda?

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:33.220
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:34.760
Let's go PriPara!
